## Concrete change
Add a scenario to `tools/story/test/story_browser_scenarios.cjs` (or extend `assertCounterCore` in `story_feature_load.cjs`):

  await scenario(page, 'toolbar-5-cluster-structure-rf2-v58dm', async () => {
